# RE = Read Email (manual, per case)

**Chat scope:** Email processing chat only (`EMAIL-PROCESSING-AGENT.md`).

**Always stick to the processing form:** Full 7-step output from **sprinklr-read-answer-email** SKILL.md.

**AI model (ABSOLUTE):** Model picker stays **Auto**. **Grok is banned.**

## When user sends **RE** / **re**

1. Run extract (visible Sprinklr case only):
   ```powershell
   Set-Location "c:\Users\PC ENTER\Desktop\Citrix"; uv run python .cursor/skills/sprinklr-read-answer-email/run.py
   ```
2. Script prints **CUSTOMER EMAIL** + **`RE_PENDING_SOUND`** — no audio yet.
3. Output full **7-step RE** (sections 1–7). Section **7. Summary of response** must be the **last** segment.
4. **Audio (automatic):** Project hook `.cursor/hooks/re_complete_sound_hook.py` plays **Prowler** when your response includes section 7 after a pending RE extract. Terminal/logs: **`RE_COMPLETE_SOUND`**. You do **not** need to run a separate sound command.
5. **Manual fallback:** user types **`sound`** → `uv run python .cursor/skills/sprinklr-email-automation/re_complete_sound.py --play`
6. User sends **PR** / **LF** when ready; next case → **RE** again.

## 7-step output

1. Customer summary  
2. Verification  
3. Transfer eligibility  
4a/4b. Backend / instructions  
5. Instructions on handling case  
6. Your response to customer (German, code block)  
7. Summary of response (EN) — **audio after this section (hook)**

## Integrity

- One visible case only; discard prior Fall # context on each new **RE**.
- PR pastes latest RE for the **same visible Fall #** only.

## Hooks note

Requires project hooks enabled (`.cursor/hooks.json`). Reload Cursor if hook was just added. View **Output → Hooks** if sound does not play.
